WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.250
Two numbers add to 20.

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:07.410
One is 4 more than the other.

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:08.660
Call the smaller n.

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:12.440
n + n + 4 = 20

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:15.000
2n = 16

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.013
n = 8, and the other is 12.
